    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to JOB!</strong><br><br>Do you have what it takes to increase Shareholder Value \ud83d\udcc8?<br><br>Are you obsessed with Customer Satisfaction \ud83d\udc81\ud83c\udffb?<br><br>Can you lift things \ud83d\udce6?<br><br>Apply Now and climb to the top of the Company Scoreboard!<br><br><i>Remember: Company Loves You!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.poster.avif?t=1642209376\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.webm?t=1642209376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.mp4?t=1642209376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fulfillment is a short, social-commentary game about working at a fulfillment center. Each day you will tackle an increasingly complex set of rules and restrictions, trying to make enough to afford rent and basic necessities. It's meant to be a small, bite-size taste of the full experience in this line of work - a single playthough takes only about 20 minutes (provided you make it all the way to the end).<br><br>The game is and will always be 100% free without any micro-transaction!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to JOB!</strong><br><br>Do you have what it takes to increase Shareholder Value \ud83d\udcc8?<br><br>Are you obsessed with Customer Satisfaction \ud83d\udc81\ud83c\udffb?<br><br>Can you lift things \ud83d\udce6?<br><br>Apply Now and climb to the top of the Company Scoreboard!<br><br><i>Remember: Company Loves You!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.poster.avif?t=1642209376\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.webm?t=1642209376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1172900/extras/519e3b0435f7752adcd553ae59f0f831.mp4?t=1642209376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fulfillment is a short, social-commentary game about working at a fulfillment center. Each day you will tackle an increasingly complex set of rules and restrictions, trying to make enough to afford rent and basic necessities. It's meant to be a small, bite-size taste of the full experience in this line of work - a single playthough takes only about 20 minutes (provided you make it all the way to the end).<br><br>The game is and will always be 100% free without any micro-transaction!",
